            "id": "000001d",
            "elType": "widget",
            "widgetType": "text-editor",
            "settings": {
              "editor": "<p class=\"north-intro\">A sticking internal door, loose cupboard fitting or an unfinished trim. Describe the detail and the access needed.</p><h2>What a brief should include</h2><ul><li>The room and the issue you can see.</li><li>Any access or timing constraints.</li><li>Whether materials have already been chosen.</li></ul><h2>What sits outside this example</h2><p>Gas, mains electrical, structural, asbestos and other specialist work are excluded. This showcase provides no technical building advice or real quotations.</p>"
