          {
            "id": "000002c",
            "elType": "widget",
            "widgetType": "text-editor",
            "settings": {
              "editor": "<h2>No enquiry collection</h2><p>The demonstration form validates in your browser. It has no sending endpoint and makes no booking. Entries are cleared after completion. Please use fictional details.</p><h2>WordPress administration</h2><p>Local editor sessions use ordinary WordPress login cookies. These are separate from the visitor form. Never expose this local installation, its demonstration administrator account or editor session to the internet.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Fonts are served locally. The showcase contains no analytics. An external link to Love Yours Media uses that website\u2019s own privacy terms. A future hosting provider may keep access logs.</p>"
            },
            "elements": []
          }
        ]
